<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: VP Bank posts higher 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>VP Bank posts higher 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>VADUZ, Liechtenstein 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996.</p>
<p>				   (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			61.03	     vs 47.56</p>
<p> Operating profit	     91.49	     vs 74.78</p>
<p> Provisions, writeoffs	16.07	     vs 12.73</p>
<p> Interest income		65.14	     vs 67.66</p>
<p> Commission income	    61.20	     vs 50.20</p>
<p>Forex,precious metals</p>
<p>  trading income		20.02	     vs 14.64</p>
<p> Securities trading income  25.61	     vs 19.60</p>
<p> Other income		   12.04	     vs 4.84</p>
<p> Cash flow			107.56	    vs 87.51</p>
<p> Dividend (sfr) bearer shr  48		  vs 44</p>
<p>Dividend (sfr) reg'd shrs</p>
<p>  and participation certs   12		  vs 11</p>
<p> Assets under management    19,100	    vs 15,000</p>
<p>Note - Full name of asset management bank is Vervaltungs- und Privat-Bank AG. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
